*   $C = KC_{air}$.
*   $t=0$: Wire; $t=\infty$: Gap.
*   Heat loss formula: $\frac{1}{2} \frac{C_1 C_2}{C_1 + C_2} (\Delta V)^2$.
*   Force: $Q^2/(2A\epsilon_0)$.

## 29. Common Mistakes Students Make
*   Using resistor formulas for capacitors (Parallel is $\sum C$).
*   Forgetting to subtract potentials ($V_1 - V_2$) correctly in common potential problems.
*   Ignoring common overlapping area in shifted plate problems.

